This artifact redistributes model weights authored by BAAI (Beijing Academy of
Artificial Intelligence).

  Model:   BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5
  Source:  https://huggingface.co/BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5
  Licence: MIT, as declared in the model card metadata at the address above

The weights are MODIFIED. This project converts the author's `model.safetensors`
to GGUF at F16 - a container change and a float32-to-float16 cast - so that a
single in-process runtime can serve both the encoder and the generator. Nothing
is retrained, pruned or otherwise altered, and no claim of authorship is made.

The conversion is byte-reproducible: the source digests, the converter commit and
the exact command are recorded at dependencyskills/encoder/RECIPE.md inside this
artifact, and re-running it yields an identical file. Anyone can therefore verify
that what is shipped here is the author's model and nothing else.

The upstream repository publishes no LICENSE file and no copyright line. The
model card's licence declaration is cited as the authoritative statement, and
the MIT terms it names are reproduced at META-INF/LICENSE.
